  "attribution": {
    "observed": "A sent heartbeat failed at source-query-deadline-admission; the source exit retains reply_gate >=1s as its lifetime slowest heartbeat stage. Capture/sender/interrupt joined. Both services remained READY; A agent faulted and then reconnected. This is not recurrence of service exit 1066.",
